ple stand for everybody  has a plan for you your parents your  friends your colleagues your customers  your suppliers your investors everybody  has a plan for you of what you should be  doing with your life that serves them if  you don't have a great plan for yourself  you're just going to be following  everybody else's plan you're never going  to get anywhere amazing and so whether  you believe in finding the one word and  applying that to your life in your  business or you go some other path the  idea of self-awareness is really  important why I find it so helpful is  because I've realized that everything in  my life has led up to where I am right  now and believe has always played a part  in it believe is my one word it's always  played a part of it my favorite songs  about believe my favorite movie is  Seabiscuit which is about believe my  parents taught me believe everything has  been good in my life came through the  lens of believe but it happened  at random these random moments of  greatness happened to me when you  understand what your one word is when  you have the self-awareness then now you  could take that and start planning so  that these good things happen to you on  purpose going forward that you recognize  them that you start hanging around the  right people that you start making the  powerful clear decisions that you start  getting a result you start achieving  your goals otherwise you're going to  continue to live a random path and you  can continue to live up to other  people's expectations of what they want  for you instead of the life that you  want from yourself and so whether you're  going with one word you have another  tool to help you having a self-awareness  to understand who you are what you're  staying for why you're here what the  powerful thing is that you want to do  makes a huge difference for your clarity  your focus and for your ability to  follow through and actually achieving  that ultimate goal for yourself so those  are my suggestions on the seven reasons  why you have not yet achieved your  ultimate goal I'd love to know what do  you guys think always your favorite rule  and why did I miss an eight nine-ten  that you want to add to the list let me  know down in the comments to be curious  if you grab what you guys have to say  I also want to give a quick shout out to  Helena of throw sky from Helena  Ostrovsky calm thank you so much and  Lena picking up a copy of my book your  one word it really really really means a  lot to me and I hope you're enjoying the  read thank you guys again for watching I  believe in you I hope you continue to  believe in yourself and whatever your  one word is much love I'll see you soon
 

